<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shoulders">Shoulders for Frost Mage DPS Phase 1 Pre-Raid</h4>Three options for shoulders, and they all perform fairly differently. The <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56399/mantle-of-master-cho">
<img alt="Mantle of Master Cho" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_robe_dungeonrobe_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mantle of Master Cho</span></a> is the best, with two gear secondary stats, this doesn't even require reforging.<br/>The latter two have mastery so they perform a lot worse, the <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58157/meadow-mantle">
<img alt="Meadow Mantle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_robe_dungeonrobe_c_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Meadow Mantle</span></a> is slightly better than the <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=63463/mantle-of-the-eastern-lords">
<img alt="Mantle of the Eastern Lords" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_robe_dungeonrobe_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mantle of the Eastern Lords</span></a>.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Recommended BiS Shoulder Enchant</b>: <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62343/greater-inscription-of-charged-lodestone">
<img alt="Greater Inscription of Charged Lodestone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_bloodstone_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greater Inscription of Charged Lodestone</span></a>, requires Exalted reputation with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1171/therazane">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Therazane</span></a>.</div></div>
