<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="chest">Chest for Frost Mage DPS Phase 1 Pre-Raid</h4>Chest is pretty simple, the <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62441/robes-of-orsis">
<img alt="Robes of Orsis" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_robe_dungeonrobe_c_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Robes of Orsis</span></a> is recommended. The <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56417/robes-of-rampant-growth">
<img alt="Robes of Rampant Growth" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_robe_dungeonrobe_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Robes of Rampant Growth</span></a> is listed after and is the last item I'd suggest wearing in raid.<br/>The following chests are mostly just options to fill the slot until you obtain either of the previous two.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67133/dizzes-whirling-robe">
<img alt="Dizze's Whirling Robe" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_raidwarlock_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dizze's Whirling Robe</span></a> is listed, but because of how rare and expensive it is, I do not recommend bothering with it.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
