<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="wrist">Wrist for Frost Mage DPS Phase 1 Pre-Raid</h4>For wrists, just use <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56389/sand-silk-wristband">
<img alt="Sand Silk Wristband" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_robe_dungeonrobe_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sand Silk Wristband</span></a>. <br/>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=63484/armbands-of-exiled-architects">
<img alt="Armbands of Exiled Architects" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_robe_dungeonrobe_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Armbands of Exiled Architects</span></a> are the only other cloth wrists that aren't equipped with spirit, its secondary stats aren't great for frost mage, but they're still a good enough item to use while trying to get the pre-raid best.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Recommended BiS Bracer Enchant</b>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68786/enchant-bracer-mighty-intellect">
<img alt="Enchant Bracer - Mighty Intellect" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracer - Mighty Intellect</span></a></div></div>
