<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="feet">Feet for Frost Mage DPS Phase 1 Pre-Raid</h4>Not a lot of non-spirit cloth boots, thankfully, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62450/desert-walker-sandals">
