<span class="tinyicontxt">Ramkahen</span></a>, try to obtain and use the <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56348/slippers-of-the-twilight-prophet">
