<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="jewelry">Jewelry for Frost Mage DPS Phase 1 Pre-Raid</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="neck">Neck for Frost Mage DPS Phase 1 Pre-Raid</h4>Lots of options here but half aren't that worth looking into.<br/>Right away, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67130/dorians-lost-necklace">
<img alt="Dorian's Lost Necklace" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_forestnecklace.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dorian's Lost Necklace</span></a> is a world drop which will be unreasonably expensive, don't bother wasting your budget on it.<br/>Especially since the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62434/lightning-flash-pendant">
<img alt="Lightning Flash Pendant" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklacea8.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightning Flash Pendant</span></a> is best in slot and from reputation, and also performs better than the BoE item.<br/>
<br/>Within the item level 346 options, there's the <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56385/tauntkas-necklace">
<img alt="Tauntka's Necklace" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_necklacea1.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tauntka's Necklace</span></a> which outperforms every other same item level alternative.<br/>Until you get it, you can just use <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=57933/string-of-beaded-bubbles">
<img alt="String of Beaded Bubbles" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_45.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">String of Beaded Bubbles</span></a> from the <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a> vendor and reforge its mastery into critical strike.<div class="pad"></div>
