<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="trinkets">Trinkets for Frost Mage DPS Phase 1 Pre-Raid</h4>For trinkets, for one of the slots, just get <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62465/stump-of-time">
<img alt="Stump of Time" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_branch_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stump of Time</span></a> - not only does it have a great proc and a ton of hit which is great early - it's also a reputation item, meaning it's easy to get.<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62047/darkmoon-card-volcano">
<img alt="Darkmoon Card: Volcano" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_tarot_volcanocard.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Darkmoon Card: Volcano</span></a> is listed as the second slot, but it will be very expensive, this is an item worthwhile getting - but it might not fit your budget.<br/>
<br/>The rest of the trinkets are ordered in terms of performance.<div class="pad"></div>
<table class="grid max-width">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-background="c8" style="width: 10%; max-width: 100%;">
