<img alt="Volcanic Deck" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_ticket_tarot_stack_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Volcanic Deck</span></a></td>
