<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">Weapons for Frost Mage DPS Phase 1 Pre-Raid</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="main-hand-weapons-for-frost-mage-dps-phase-1-pre-raid">Main-Hand Weapons for Frost Mage DPS Phase 1 Pre-Raid</h4>Although the one handed weapons aren't pre-raid best in slot, they still make great alternatives if you didn't get <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64489/staff-of-sorcerer-thane-thaurissan">
<img alt="Staff of Sorcerer-Thane Thaurissan" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_staffofsorcerer_than-thaurissan.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Staff of Sorcerer-Thane Thaurissan</span></a> from archaeology.<br/>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69844/vitreous-beak-of-julak-doom">
<img alt="Vitreous Beak of Julak-Doom" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_knife_1h_cataclysm_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vitreous Beak of Julak-Doom</span></a> is listed here mostly for completion sake, its far too rare and expensive to recommend as a pre-raid item.<br/>
<br/>The rest of the weapons all have similar stats and perform similarly, just get whichever you have easiest access to.<br/>They all perform better than the 346 item level two-handed weapons.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
